### The Medical branch (MPDS-aligned)

Medical children align to the Medical Priority Dispatch System (MPDS) chief complaints, as used by Ambulance Victoria and maintained by the International Academies of Emergency Dispatch (IAED). MPDS is used here as a naming taxonomy for interagency alignment, not as a dispatch triage tool. Handover to AV then operates on shared terminology.

Medical is Not Final: every closed Medical incident must be refined to a Final child.

